error[E0524]: &string cannot refer to 'label', which has accessors
 --> $DIR/reference.nra:7:22
  |
7 |     let r: &string = shape.label;
  |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^ 'label' is reached through its getter here, which yields a value and not storage
  |
  = note: outside its class, a field with accessors is read and written only through 'get' and 'set', so a reference cannot alias its storage
  = help: copy the value into a local, pass that local, and assign the result back to 'label'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0524`.
